  "body": "Privately positioned in one of Orakei's most sought-after enclaves, this quality constructed, Brent Hulena-designed attached residence showcases stunning wide north-facing sea views, generous proportions and timeless architectural appeal. Filled with natural light, it offers a sophisticated yet highly practical lifestyle in a prized coastal location.\r\n\r\nExpansive glazing and sun-filled open-plan living connect effortlessly to multiple outdoor entertaining spaces. The designer kitchen with walk-in pantry forms the heart of the home, while a separate lounge provides flexibility as a media room, office or retreat.\r\n\r\nA versatile floor plan with generous bedrooms, excellent storage and lower-level separation easily accommodates families, guests, extended family or downsizers seeking space without compromise. Outdoors, enjoy a north-facing deck with sea views, a landscaped courtyard with outdoor fireplace and a flat lawn for children and pets.\r\n\r\nMoments from beaches, cafes, waterfront walkways, transport and the CBD, this is a rare opportunity to secure an elegant coastal home of enduring quality.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights: \r\n• CV: $4,075,000\r\n• Floor area: 313sqm (approx.)\r\n• Rates: $11,531.24 p.a.\r\n• Low-cost, well-managed body corporate shared by just three owners\r\n• Stunning wide north-facing sea views\r\n• Quality construction\r\n• Brent Hulena architectural design",
